 "name": "S17: Assembly, company wiki",
 "text_content": "No page range. Assembly.\n\nS\u014fn output (final): the company wiki.\n\nWhat happens here:\nEvery draft artifact from Sessions 1 through 16 is promoted to final or killed.\nEvery carryover item is closed, parked, or escalated.\nContradictions between early and late sessions are resolved, not smoothed.\nChef-gated items are collected into a single onboarding packet for that hire.\nThe wiki is structured for someone who has never read the book and never will.\n\nThe test: a new general manager should be able to run S\u014fn from the wiki without ever hearing the name Claire Hughes Johnson.",
 "description": "No page range. Assembly.\n\nS\u014fn output (final): the company wiki.\n\nWhat happens here:\nEvery draft artifact from Sessions 1 through 16 is promoted to final or killed.\nEvery carryover item is closed, parked, or escalated.\nContradictions between early and late sessions are resolved, not smoothed.\nChef-gated items are collected into a single onboarding packet for that hire.\nThe wiki is structured for someone who has never read the book and never will.\n\nThe test: a new general manager should be able to run S\u014fn from the wiki without ever hearing the name Claire Hughes Johnson.",
 "markdown_description": "**No page range.** Assembly.\n\n**S\u014fn output (final):** the company wiki.\n\n**What happens here:**\n*   Every draft artifact from Sessions 1 through 16 is promoted to final or killed.\n*   Every carryover item is closed, parked, or escalated.\n*   Contradictions between early and late sessions are resolved, not smoothed.\n*   Chef-gated items are collected into a single onboarding packet for that hire.\n*   The wiki is structured for someone who has never read the book and never will.\n\n**The test:** a new general manager should be able to run S\u014fn from the wiki without ever hearing the name Claire Hughes Johnson.",
